  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/pharisees/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/pharisees/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "According to Acts 23:6-8, which beliefs did the Pharisees hold that the Sadducees rejected?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/pharisees/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/pharisees> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/pharisees/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#StudyQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/pharisees/check/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In Matthew 23:2-3, what does Jesus tell the crowds to do with the Pharisees' teaching, and what does he warn them not to copy?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/pharisees/check/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/bible-graph/id/pharisees> .
